          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Today a question, a deliverable and a health alarm all reach you as a work item with an Approve button, so Approve means nothing. Next, each kind of thing that needs you is its own record, written through one verb, kept in one store, and closed by its own rule. The server folds the three into one list; every surface reads that list.",
